  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 170, Number 119 (Tuesday, July 23, 2024)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. KRISHNAMOORTHI:\nH.R. 9105.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle I, Section 8, Clause I\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nTo amend the Federal Food, Drug, and Cosmetic Act to ensure\nthe safety of food and limit the presence of contaminants in\ninfant and toddler food, and for other purposes.\n[Page H4860]\n</pre>",
